<title>ROMANIA: Romanian producer prices rise 4.0 pct in Sept.</title>
<headline>Romanian producer prices rise 4.0 pct in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Producer prices in Romanian industry rose by 4.0 percent in September from the previous month and by 62.3 percent year on year, National Statistics Board data showed.</p>
<p> ROMANIAN PRODUCER PRICES	  SEPT    AUGUST    SEPT 95</p>
<p> mth/mth change			+4.0     +4.8	+1.9</p>
<p>  extraction industry		+0.6     +2.0	+0.2</p>
<p>  processing industry		+4.6     +5.6	+2.3</p>
<p>  energy and gas industry	  +2.3     +1.3	+0.4</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
